# --- Secrets / environment (NEVER commit) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

# --- Commercial / legal material (deliberately NOT in this repo) ---
# Pricing, setup fees, discounting policy, contract terms and the open
# legal-entity question. Kept out for a specific reason, not just tidiness:
# the SERVER pulls this repo, so committing it would place commercial terms on
# the production box for no operational benefit. "It is a private repo" is not
# the control you want protecting this -- that lasts exactly until the first
# collaborator is added.
#
# The engineering content that used to live alongside it has been extracted:
#   docs/engineering-lessons.md   (the tests-that-pass-wrongly pattern)
#   docs/concierge-runbook.md §6  (conditions on the n8n env-access decision)
# If you add commercial material to that doc, it stays here. If you add
# ENGINEERING material to it, port the engineering part into docs/ instead --
# otherwise it becomes invisible to anyone working from the repo.
ryvo-operations-and-commercial-reference.md

# --- Backups (DB dumps live outside git history) ---
/backups/

# --- Node / tooling ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
